      value: Jesse
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1848884442409773243, guid: ef5da854a3366754cb3ca4b5c8237953, type: 3}
      propertyPath: secondDialogue.name
      value: Josephine
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1848884442409773243, guid: ef5da854a3366754cb3ca4b5c8237953, type: 3}
      propertyPath: mainDialogue.sentences.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1848884442409773243, guid: ef5da854a3366754cb3ca4b5c8237953, type: 3}
      propertyPath: secondDialogue.sentences.Array.size
      value: 3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1848884442409773243, guid: ef5da854a3366754cb3ca4b5c8237953, type: 3}
      propertyPath: mainDialogue.sentences.Array.data[0]
      value: What are these floating green things that I've been seeing?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1848884442409773243, guid: ef5da854a3366754cb3ca4b5c8237953, type: 3}
      propertyPath: secondDialogue.sentences.Array.data[0]
      value: These are fragments of our client's dreams. They seem to leak out of
        the Twilight for some reason.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1848884442409773243, guid: ef5da854a3366754cb3ca4b5c8237953, type: 3}
      propertyPath: secondDialogue.sentences.Array.data[1]
      value: Our development team hasn't been able to fix the bug and it has been
        getting worse lately.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1848884442409773243, guid: ef5da854a3366754cb3ca4b5c8237953, type: 3}
      propertyPath: secondDialogue.sentences.Array.data[2]
      value: If you see them, it would be helpful if you can collect them.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    m_RemovedComponents: []
  m_SourcePrefab: {fileID: 100100000, guid: ef5da854a3366754cb3ca4b5c8237953, type: 3}
